<title>ROMANIA: ROMANIAN SHIPPING - DRY CARGO, CONSTANTA PORT.</title>
<headline>ROMANIAN SHIPPING - DRY CARGO, CONSTANTA PORT.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following ships were</p>
<p>loading, discharging in the Black Sea port of Constanta on</p>
<p>Wednesday, port authorities said.</p>
<p>   SHIP		     COMMODITY    OPERATION   TONNES</p>
<p> - Al Wafic		 phosphate	dsg *	5,750</p>
<p> - Viden		    urea	     ldg	  9,450</p>
<p> - Martha		   nitrate	  ldg	  8,500</p>
<p> - Odysseas		 raw sugar	dsg	 20,000</p>
<p> - Olympia S		fertilisers    ldg	  6,475</p>
<p> - Parnassus		rolled metal   ldg *	8,498</p>
<p> - Verila		   phosphate	dsg	 10,145</p>
<p> - Despina		  urea	     ldg	  6,000</p>
<p> - Gumbet		   bauxite	  dsg *     56,005</p>
<p> - Sishen		   iron ore	 dsg	165,882</p>
<p> - Dima 2		   cement	   ldg	 11,000</p>
<p> - Aulona		   cement	   ldg	 14,500</p>
<p> - Maria D		  cement	   ldg	 28,500</p>
<p> - Ororiste		 soy grist	dsg	  9,831</p>
<p> - Ken Nichirin	   rolled metal   ldg	 16,070</p>
<p> - Ocean Friend	   rolled metal   ldg	 15,400</p>
<p>* cargo in transit</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
